  dialogs:
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Rejected. This doesn't work. A failure
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: But now I can see exactly what's wrong with it.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: The logic underneath is broken. Most people wouldn't even notice. We
      do.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: We do not ignore what others overlook.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: We will fix it. We will make this game undeniable.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: PERFECT, as it is.
